{"parse": {"title": "Usurper", "pageid": 556, "revid": 46165, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\"><b>Overview</b></span></h2>\n<p><b>Usurper</b> is a summoner unit with an ability it is <span class=\"C(Legendary) Tsh(Game) game-font-face\">Legendary</span> unit. He is only obtainable through <a href=\"/wiki/Summon\" title=\"Summon\">summons</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Evolving\">Evolving</span></h2>\n<p><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Usurper</strong> can evolve into <a href=\"/wiki/Usurper_(Founder)\" title=\"Usurper (Founder)\">Usurper (Founder)</a> with the following materials:\n</p>\n<table class=\"article-table game-font-face\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Required Items:\n</td>\n<td style=\"display: flex; gap: 25px;\"><span>x1 <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Usurper</strong><br /></span><span style=\"display: inline-block;\">x3 <span><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Path Branch\"><img alt=\"Path Branch\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/4/48/Path_Branch.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20220911163347\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Path Branch.png\" data-image-key=\"Path_Branch.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> <span class=\"dottedText\"><a href=\"/wiki/Evolution\" title=\"Evolution\">Path Branch</a></span></span><br /></span><span style=\"display: inline-block;\">x8 <span class=\"XPFood-tooltip\" data-param=\"Mysterious Fluid\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Mysterious Fluid\"><img alt=\"Mysterious Fluid\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/7/72/Mysterious_Fluid.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20230101141428\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-nam